{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は乃木坂浪漫のイベントでした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第3回目！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も雨降りましたね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3回やったけど\n全部 雨らしいです(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さすが乃木坂。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のメンバーは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさ、ろってぃー、かずみん、ひめたん、なーちゃん、若月、まあや、中田\nの8人"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"司会は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我らが早出さん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず\n3年以上前に\n浪漫で読んだ作品を１人ずつ読んで登場しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カムパネルラ言えました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/10/5493362/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうそれだけで感動"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/10/5493362/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあとは\n１人ずつオヌヌメの本の紹介しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の紹介した本は\n中田ママが読んでて譲り受けたものです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/10/5493362/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あえて\nタイトルは書かないでおきます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通にポジティブな本なんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでも知りたい人は\n行った人から聞くか\n運営ブログがあがったら、それを見てください(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続いて\n本のプレゼントの抽選会がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイン書きしました( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本にサイン書きとか著者の気分(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たった8名様、おめぺろ(๑>؂<๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その次は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ビロードのうさぎ』という\n冬にぴったりな絵本をみんなで朗読しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい絵本でしたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/10/5493362/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次に朗読のリクエストコーナー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"755で募ってたやつですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/10/5493362/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田もリトークしたけど、あれです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃー、なーちゃん、まあや、中田で\nなーちゃんの好きな『銀牙』の朗読をしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セリフは二言しかなかったんだけど\n片方のセリフが中田的に\n正直言いずらい、というか\n人生で使ったことない言葉で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ、\n前の前の前の前のブログ(1148)にも通ずるような言葉で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張りました(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に\n『今、話したい誰かがいる』の歌詞の朗読をしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなり盛りだくさんな感じでしたが\n来てくださったみなさん、\nいかがでしたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/10/5493362/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださって\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/10/5493362/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/10/5493362/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}